### Stage 1: The Gatekeeper (Application Properties & Controller)
Before a file even reaches your service layer, Spring Boot needs to reject oversized payloads to prevent Denial of Service (DoS) attacks.
Update your application.properties or application.yml to enforce the absolute maximum file size.
```properties
